<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<style>
  /*
    Final Acceptance Certificate — geometry from 13_Sites_FAC.pdf.

    One row per site: that is the point of the form. Sites accepted with no
    outstanding items list share a single certificate, so the grid is padded to
    a fixed row count and a 1-site certificate looks like a 13-site one.
  */
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    width: 595.32pt; height: 841.92pt; position: relative;
    font-family: Calibri, Carlito, "DejaVu Sans", Verdana, sans-serif;
    font-size: 6.4pt; color: #000; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
  }
  .ar {
    direction: rtl;
    font-family: "Noto Naskh Arabic", "Noto Sans Arabic", Tahoma, Amiri, "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
  }
  .abs { position: absolute; }

  .banner { left: 0; width: 595.32pt; text-align: center; font-size: 5.4pt; color: #1a7f37; }

  table { border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%; }
  td, th { border: 0.6pt solid #000; padding: 1.6pt 3pt; vertical-align: middle; }

  .logo { left: 380pt; top: 104pt; width: 145pt; text-align: right; }
  .logo img { height: 26pt; }

  .sheet { left: 36pt; top: 146pt; width: 523pt; }

  .head td { height: 24pt; background: #f2f2f2; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; font-size: 8.4pt; }
  .blurb td { height: 100pt; vertical-align: top; font-size: 5.9pt; line-height: 1.42; }

  .meta td { height: 13pt; }
  .meta .k { width: 96pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .meta .v { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; }
  .meta .k-ar { width: 128pt; text-align: right; font-weight: bold; }

  .grid th { height: 14pt; background: #f2f2f2; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; font-size: 6.8pt; }
  .grid td { height: 13.6pt; text-align: center; font-size: 6.2pt; }

  .sign td { height: 13pt; }
  .sign .title { height: 15pt; background: #f2f2f2; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; }
  .sign img { height: 26pt; }
  /* Stamp sits beside the signature, clear of it — on the GCL they overlap,
     but on a certificate both need to read cleanly. */
  .sign .stamp { position: absolute; left: 132pt; top: 1pt; height: 30pt; opacity: 0.92; }
  .sign .sig { position: absolute; left: 14pt; top: 3pt; height: 26pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="abs banner" style="top: 18pt;">This Content is Public</div>

  <div class="abs logo">{{#if logoTawal}}<img src="{{logoTawal}}" alt="TAWAL" />{{/if}}</div>

  <div class="abs sheet">
    <table class="head">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 300pt;">Final Acceptance Certificate</td>
        <td class="ar">شهادة استلام نهائية</td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <table class="blurb">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 300pt;">
          According to the Agreement concluded between the undersigned and upon the supplier's
          delivery of all works with the repair of all defects , malfunctions and errors contained
          in the Preliminary Acceptance Certificate ( PAC ) for the site(s), TAWAL confirms that
          the site(s) has been received without any outstanding items list (OIL) .<br /><br />
          Accordingly , these works were handed over to the project management at TAWAL and became
          under its responsibility .<br /><br />
          it is understood that this certificate does not exempt the supplier from completing the
          work according to the technical and contractual specifications in force at TAWAL .
        </td>
        <td class="ar">
          حسب الاتفاقية المبرمه بين الموقعين ادناه و بناء على تسليم المقاول جميع الأعمال مع اصلاح
          العيوب و الأعطال و الأخطاء الوارده في شهادة الاستلام الابتدائي ؛ تؤكد شركة توال أنه تم
          استلام الموقع / المواقع من دون أي مخرجات معلقه ؛ و عليه جرى تسليم هذه الأعمال الى إدارة
          المشروع في شركة توال و أصبح تحت مسئوليتها .<br /><br />
          ومن المفهوم إن هذه الشهادة لا تعفى المقاول من إتمام العمل بحسب المواصفات الفنية
          والتعاقدية المعمول بها في شركة توال.
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <table class="meta">
      <tr>
        <td class="k">Project Name :</td>
        <td class="v" style="width: 200pt;">{{projectName}}</td>
        <td style="width: 99pt;"></td>
        <td class="k-ar ar">اسم المشروع :</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="k">Sub-Project Name :</td>
        <td class="v">{{subProjectName}}</td>
        <td></td>
        <td class="k-ar ar">اسم المشروع الفرعي:</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="k">Contractor Name :</td>
        <td class="v">{{contractorName}}</td>
        <td></td>
        <td class="k-ar ar">اسم المقاول :</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="k">P.O No. :</td>
        <td class="v">{{poNumber}}</td>
        <td></td>
        <td class="k-ar ar">رقم أمر الشراء:</td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <table class="grid">
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 96pt;">Site ID</th>
        <th style="width: 100pt;">Region</th>
        <th style="width: 100pt;">District</th>
        <th>WO Number</th>
      </tr>
      {{#each rows}}
      <tr>
        <td>{{this.siteNo}}</td>
        <td>{{this.region}}</td>
        <td>{{this.district}}</td>
        <td>{{this.woNumber}}</td>
      </tr>
      {{/each}}
    </table>

    <table class="sign">
      <tr>
        <td class="title" style="width: 300pt;">Contractor Project Manager</td>
        <td class="title" style="text-align: left; padding-left: 4pt;">TAWAL Project Manager</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Name : {{contractorPmName}}</td>
        <td>Name :</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="height: 34pt; position: relative;">
          {{#if signature}}<img class="sig" src="{{signature}}" alt="" />{{/if}}
          {{#if stamp}}<img class="stamp" src="{{stamp}}" alt="" />{{/if}}
        </td>
        <td>Sign :</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Date : {{issueDate}}</td>
        <td>Date :</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="abs banner" style="top: 800pt;">This Content is Public</div>
</body>
</html>
